### What I saw

A storage volume pins its datacenter, and the wait never says so: no 5090 or 4090 in EUR-NO-1 for 13 minutes while EU-RO-1 had stock, and the CLI said nothing. Owner decision O7: no hard datacenter pin, overridable. In the machines redesign as M6; not yet in Plan 40's pack.

